        guide_p1_html: `<p>King's Road is a memorization game where you cycle through <b>Study → Review → Boss</b> to commit Scripture to memory.</p><div style="text-align:center; font-size:14px; line-height:2.4; margin:16px 0;">📖 Study a verse<br>↓<br>🛡️ Checkpoint (every 4–7 verses)<br>↓<br>🐲 Boss Battle (full chapter review)<br>↓<br>🔄 Review (up to 7 stages)<br>↓<br>⚔️ King's Trials (unlocked after boss)</div><p style="font-size:13px; color:#888;">Each clear stacks review stages and raises your gem rewards!</p>`,
        guide_p2_title: '📝 Recitation Steps',
        guide_p2_html: `<p style="font-size:13px; color:#888; margin-bottom:12px;">Each verse is fully memorized by going through these 5 steps in order.</p><ol style="padding-left:20px; line-height:2.2;"><li><b>Read</b> — Read the full verse <span style="font-size:12px; color:#9b59b6;">🎤 Voice recognition available!</span></li><li><b>Fill Initials</b> — Find the right word using initial-letter hints</li><li><b>Choose the Word</b> — Pick the correct answer from three options</li><li><b>Fill the Scroll</b> — Fill in the blanks under a time limit</li><li><b>Order the Words</b> — Arrange words in the correct order from memory</li></ol><p style="font-size:12px; color:#aaa; margin-top:8px;">💡 Reviews only repeat steps 2 & 5.</p>`,
        guide_p3_title: '⏰ Review System',
        guide_p3_html: `<p style="font-size:13px; color:#888; margin-bottom:10px;">Review at the right time to earn <b>bigger gem rewards!</b></p><div style="font-size:13px; margin:0; line-height:1;"><div style="padding:8px 12px; border-radius:8px; background:rgba(149,165,166,0.12); margin-bottom:6px;"><span style="color:#888;">📖 First Clear → 💎 10 gems</span></div><div style="padding:8px 12px; border-radius:8px; background:rgba(142,68,173,0.12); margin-bottom:6px;"><b style="color:#8e44ad;">Review after 10 min → 💎 15 gems</b></div><div style="padding:8px 12px; border-radius:8px; background:rgba(41,128,185,0.12); margin-bottom:6px;"><b style="color:#2980b9;">Review after 1 hr → 💎 20 gems</b></div><div style="padding:8px 12px; border-radius:8px; background:rgba(230,126,34,0.12); margin-bottom:6px;"><b style="color:#e67e22;">Review after 6 hrs → 💎 50 gems</b></div><div style="padding:8px 12px; border-radius:8px; background:rgba(231,76,60,0.12); margin-bottom:6px;"><b style="color:#e74c3c;">Review after 23 hrs → 💎 60 gems</b></div><div style="padding:8px 12px; border-radius:8px; background:rgba(169,50,38,0.12); margin-bottom:6px;"><b style="color:#a93226;">Review after 3 days → 💎 90 gems</b></div><div style="padding:8px 12px; border-radius:8px; background:rgba(100,30,22,0.12);"><b style="color:#7B241C;">7+ days → 💎 90+ gems (keeps growing)</b></div></div><p style="font-size:12px; color:#aaa; margin-top:8px;">💡 Check the map screen button to see when reviews are ready!</p>`,
        guide_p4_title: "⚔️ King's Trials",
        guide_p4_html: `<p style="font-size:13px; color:#888; margin-bottom:12px;">Unlock <b>4 special challenges</b> after clearing a Boss Battle to push your memory to the limit!</p><div style="line-height:1.8; font-size:14px;"><div style="padding:10px 12px; border-radius:8px; background:rgba(155,89,182,0.1); margin-bottom:8px;"><b>🕊️ Endurance Trial</b><br><span style="font-size:13px; color:#777;">Recite the verse aloud — scored by voice recognition</span></div><div style="padding:10px 12px; border-radius:8px; background:rgba(231,76,60,0.1); margin-bottom:8px;"><b>🎯 Address Trial</b><br><span style="font-size:13px; color:#777;">See the verse, guess the exact chapter and verse number</span></div><div style="padding:10px 12px; border-radius:8px; background:rgba(41,128,185,0.1); margin-bottom:8px;"><b>⌨️ Memory Trial</b><br><span style="font-size:13px; color:#777;">See the address, type the entire verse from memory</span></div><div style="padding:10px 12px; border-radius:8px; background:rgba(39,174,96,0.1);"><b>📖 Verse Trial</b><br><span style="font-size:13px; color:#777;">See the address, pick the correct verse from 4 choices</span></div></div><p style="font-size:12px; color:#aaa; margin-top:8px;">💡 Complete all 4 to finish the King's Trials!</p>`,
        guide_p5_title: '🛡️ Guild & Raid',
        guide_p5_html: `<p style="font-size:13px; color:#888; margin-bottom:10px;">Join up to 25 members to <b>slay dragons</b> in Guild Raids!</p><p style="margin-bottom:4px;"><b>🐲 Raid Damage</b></p><p style="font-size:13px; color:#666; margin-bottom:10px;">Every activity — studying, reviewing, boss battles, and trials — converts into raid damage. Resets every Monday.</p><p style="margin-bottom:4px;"><b>🏆 Weekly Rewards</b></p><div style="font-size:13px; color:#555; line-height:1.9; margin-bottom:10px;">🐚 Scales — used to buy personal equipment<br>🦷 Horn Fragments — used to buy guild equipment<br>🧠 Head Skins — used to evolve guild equipment</div><p style="margin-bottom:4px;"><b>⚙️ Equipment</b></p><p style="font-size:13px; color:#666;">Upgrade personal gear (Ephesians 6) and guild gear (Revelation) to boost your raid damage!</p>`,
        guide_p6_title: '💎 Gems, Missions & Achievements',
        guide_p6_html: `<p style="margin-bottom:4px;"><b>💎 How to Earn Gems:</b></p><ul style="padding-left:18px; line-height:1.9; font-size:13px; margin-bottom:10px;"><li>Study & review completions</li><li>King's Trials clears</li><li>Daily/weekly missions & point milestones</li><li>Achievements</li><li>Temple idle production</li></ul><p style="margin-bottom:4px;"><b>📅 Mission Reset:</b></p><div style="font-size:13px; color:#666; line-height:1.9; margin-bottom:10px;">Daily missions — reset at midnight<br>Weekly missions — reset Monday midnight</div><p style="margin-bottom:4px;"><b>🏰 Temple:</b> Upgrade with gems → increases idle gem production</p><p style="margin-top:8px; margin-bottom:4px;"><b>🏆 7 Achievement Types:</b></p><div style="font-size:12px; color:#666; line-height:1.7;">🗓️ Attendance · 📖 Verses · 🐲 Boss Wins · 💎 Gems Earned · ✨ Perfect Runs · 🏰 Temple Level · 🌅 Early Morning</div>`,

